#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:60
msgid ""
"The email template is one HTML source you edit directly — the preview on the "
"right renders this exact code."
msgstr "郵件模板就是可直接編輯的 HTML 原始碼，右側預覽依它即時渲染。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:61 includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:125
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "郵件主旨"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:62
msgid ""
"Tokens: {{name}} {{email}} — same braces as the body. Leave empty to use the "
"default wording."
msgstr "可用變數：{{name}} {{email}}（與正文同一套花括號）；留空用預設文案。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:63
msgid "Email HTML source"
msgstr "郵件模板原始碼（HTML）"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:64
msgid ""
"This is the complete email body — the header text lives here too: look for "
"the <!-- 表头标题 --> comment and edit that line. {{...}} tokens are filled "
"with inquiry data. Clear it and save to restore the default."
msgstr ""
"這裡就是郵件正文的完整原始碼；頁首也在這裡改——找到 <!-- 表頭標題 --> 註解，直"
"接改那一行文字。{{...}} 由詢盤資料注入。清空並儲存 = 恢復預設模板。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:67
msgid "Enable auto-confirmation"
msgstr "啟用自動確認"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:68
msgid ""
"When on, the visitor immediately receives the auto-confirmation at the "
"address they typed. Reply-To points at the inquiry inbox."
msgstr ""
"開啟後，訪客提交成功會立刻收到自動確認郵件（寄到表單裡填的信箱，Reply-To 指向"
"詢盤收件人）。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:69 includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:71
msgid "Language"
msgstr "編輯語言"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:70
msgid "Default group"
msgstr "預設組"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:72
msgid "Add language group"
msgstr "新增語言組"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:73
msgid "Delete this language group"
msgstr "刪除該語言組"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:74
msgid "Delete this language group and its template?"
msgstr "刪除該語言組及其模板？"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:75
msgid "Language group added."
msgstr "語言組已新增。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:76
msgid "Language group deleted."
msgstr "語言組已刪除。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:77
msgid "That language group already exists."
msgstr "該語言組已存在。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:78
msgid ""
"Matched against the visitor’s browser language ({{lang}}): full tag first "
"(zh-CN), then the primary language (zh). Anything unmatched uses the "
"“Default group” — the one template with no language attached."
msgstr ""
"依訪客瀏覽器語言（{{lang}}）比對：先比完整標籤（zh-CN），再比主要語言（zh）；"
"都比對不上就用「預設組」——它不分語言，是最後的後備。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:79
msgid ""
"These labels only affect {{rows}} in this language group. Leave empty to use "
"the wording the form itself submitted."
msgstr "這裡的標籤只作用於目前語言組的 {{rows}}；留空則用前端表單送出的措辭。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:80
msgid "Used when the visitor’s browser language matches no language group"
msgstr "訪客的瀏覽器語言沒有比對到任何語言組時，寄這一份"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:81
msgid "Drag to reorder"
msgstr "拖曳排序"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:82
msgid ""
"Drag the handle to reorder — the table rows in {{rows}} follow this order."
msgstr "拖左側把手調整順序——{{rows}} 的表格列就依這個順序排。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:83
msgid "Values marked * come from the front end:"
msgstr "帶 * 的值需要前端送出："

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:84
msgid ""
"Every row of {{rows}} also comes from the submitted form fields — new form "
"fields show up here automatically."
msgstr ""
"{{rows}} 的每一列也來自前端表單的欄位（表單加了新欄位，這裡會自動多一列）。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:85
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "預覽"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:86
msgid "Rendered live from the code on the left."
msgstr "依左側原始碼即時渲染。"

