#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:89
msgid "Send test email"
msgstr "發送測試郵件"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:90
msgid ""
"Renders the sample email and sends it to the inquiry inbox — never to a "
"customer."
msgstr "依目前模板渲染一封範例郵件，寄到詢盤收件信箱，不會寄給客戶。"

#: includes/trait-eln-i18n.php:91
